{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"audit-workflow","title":"安全审计流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/practice/audit-workflow","wordCount":1111,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"upgradeable-contracts","title":"可升级合约安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/practice/upgradeable-contracts","wordCount":726,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"incident-response","title":"安全事件响应与监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/practice/incident-response","wordCount":1033,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"工程实践\">工程实践</h1><p>本章将安全知识转化为可落地的工程流程。从审计工作流的标准化执行，到可升级合约模式下的特殊安全考量，再到安全事件发生后的应急响应与持续监控体系。</p>\n<p>安全不是一次性的审计报告，而是贯穿合约全生命周期的持续过程——从设计、编码、测试、部署到运行时监控与事件响应，每个阶段都需要对应的安全实践。</p>\n"}